  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A] [Em7]\n[G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[Em7]It's a hopeless situation [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n[Em7]And I'm starting to believe [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C]\n[Am] [Em/A] [Em7]That this hopeless situation [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n[Em7]Is what I'm trying to achieve [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[Cmaj7/D]But I try to run on\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]It's all or none\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]all or none\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[Em7]Here's the selfless confession [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n[Em7]Leading me back to war [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C]\n[Am] [Em/A] [Em7]Can we help that our destinations [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n[Em7]Are the ones we've been before [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[Cmaj7/D]I still try to run on\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]But it's all or none\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]all or none\n\n{section: Solo 1}\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A] (x4)\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[Em7]To myself I surrender [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n[Em7]To the one I'll never please [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]\n\n{section: Refrão 3}\n[Cmaj7/D]But I still try to run on\nOh, I still try to run on\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]But it's all or none\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A]all or none\n\n{section: Instrumental}\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A] (x2)\n\n{section: Solo 2}\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A] (x5)\n\n{section: Fade Out}\n[Em7] [G6/C#] [C] [Cadd9] [C] [Am] [Em/A] (x3)"
